  {
   "id": "raidou-remastered-the-mystery-of-the-soulless-army-337024@1.10",
   "gameId": "raidou-remastered-the-mystery-of-the-soulless-army-337024",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.10",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-16T00:10:11.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have released patch 1.10 for RAIDOU Remastered: The Mystery of the Soulless Army. Additionally, accompanying this update, we would like to share a message from the game's Producer/Director, Yamai Kazuyuki.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45558630/fc5bee167906c384a15da7ea4743ff0b43d1f218.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Please see the details of the fixes included",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) QOL Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "MAG can now be collected through gun attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a “Hold” input option for Weak Sword Attacks and Strong Sword Attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Button/key assigned to safeguarding demon allies is now remappable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Demon allies will no longer waste MAG by using skills unnecessarily once battle ends.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added “Retry battle on another difficulty” option when Raidou is defeated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now sell demonic materials at Konnou-ya.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now travel directly to Konnou-ya through Dragon Founts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ON/OFF toggles for the next objective UI, destination icons, and applicable investigation skills so players can enjoy the atmosphere of the original game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enhanced carry-over elements for New Game+.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Totality",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Raidou's level, stats, money, Devil Chart, and accumulated Loyalty will be carried over. Summoner Skills, swords forged through Sword Alchemy, and items will also be carried over, with some exceptions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Luxuries",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Raidou's money, Devil Chart, and accumulated Loyalty will be carried over. Summoner Skills, swords forged through Sword Alchemy, and items will also be carried over, with some exceptions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Basics",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Raidou's Devil Chart and accumulated Loyalty will be carried over.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balance adjustments for the following battles",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Episode 1: Gashadokuro",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Episode 1: Ichimokuren",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Episode 8: Mishaguji",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Final Episode battles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Devil Chart now displays demon registration completion rate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ON/OFF toggle for shortening demon fusion animations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "After demon fusion, the game will no longer return to the fusion top menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shortened animation when reforging a sword that has already been crafted in Sword Alchemy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced downtime after summoning a demon ally in the field.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ability to skip the greeting animation during demon reports.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Even when Raidou’s title is manually selected, the rank-up animation will play when a new title is unlocked.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "When completing a case file, the name of the completed quest will now be shown in the completion animation (to avoid confusion about which quest was cleared).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced the frequency of Gouto saying “Use your gun.”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Other",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various bug fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continued support of RAIDOU Remastered: The Mystery of the Soulless Army!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
